    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSELECTABLE COLOR:\u003c/strong\u003e Our\u003cstrong\u003e 24W LED\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cstrong\u003ecircular \u003c/strong\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDownlight \u003cstrong\u003e- Frameless QUASAR -\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cstrong\u003eOSRAM \u003c/strong\u003eCHIP DURIS E 2835 has a color temperature selector, choosing between cold white, neutral white and warm white. The opening angle of the luminaire is 120º. It can be converted into a surface mounted ceiling light with the downlight ring:\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.factorled.com/en/led-downlight-accessories/2021-frame-converter-in-ceiling-light-for-downlight-quasar-8w-8435612911536.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"btn btn-default\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eGO \u0026gt;\u0026gt;\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2 style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003eFrameless LED Downlight 24W QUASAR - OSRAM CHIP DURIS E 2835 - CCT\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003eOur\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eFrameless\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eLED\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;Downlight with a power rating of\u003cstrong\u003e\u0026nbsp;24W\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;stands out for how easy it is to handle, delivering precise, tailored lighting in any indoor space. With this type of LED luminaire you can achieve light made to measure for any kind of business.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThese\u003cstrong\u003e\u0026nbsp;recessed lights\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;have no frame, so their modern design stands out and lends a cutting-edge style.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThanks to its selectable colour temperature system you can adapt it to the needs of your business or your home, choosing the ideal colour for each room or space.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThe high-efficiency light source with\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eSMD2835 OSRAM chip\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;technology delivers high luminosity, making it a perfect replacement for traditional spotlights while providing savings of over 80%.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eIts practical slim design makes installation far simpler.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eIts high colour rendering index above 85 guarantees a natural reproduction of colours.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eApplications of the Frameless LED Downlight 24W QUASAR - OSRAM CHIP DURIS E 2835 - CCT\u0026nbsp;\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u0026nbsp;Shops\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u0026nbsp;Restaurants\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u0026nbsp;Museums\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u0026nbsp;Shopping arcades\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u0026nbsp;Shopping centres\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u0026nbsp;Offices\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u0026nbsp;Corridors\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u0026nbsp;Shop windows\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAt FactorLED we guarantee that our products carry a QUALITY warranty and provide every element required for WHOLESALE DISTRIBUTION, IMPORT or SALE, including the technical data sheet for each LED product.\u003c/p\u003e",
